{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09278","headline":"山行积雨归途始霁 · 韦应物","name":"山行积雨归途始霁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"揽辔穷登降，阴雨遘二旬。\n但见白云合，不睹岩中春。\n急涧岂易揭，峻涂良难遵。\n深林猿声冷，沮洳虎迹新。\n始霁升阳景，山水阅清晨。\n杂花积如雾，百卉萋已陈。\n鸣驺屡骧首，归路自忻忻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09278.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09278","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}